<div class="badge success-badge">📊 Analysis Complete</div>

<h1 class="title">Project Analysis Complete</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Analysis for <strong>{{projectName}}</strong> has completed successfully. Your repository is ready for the next step.</p>

<div class="feature-list">
  <h3>Analysis Details</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Project:</strong> {{projectName}}</li>
    <li><strong>Completed:</strong> {{timestamp}}</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p style="color: #a3a3a3; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px;">
  Review the detected stack, Dockerfile, and configuration in your dashboard before creating or deploying the project.
</p>

{{#if actionUrl}}
{{> button url=actionUrl label="View Analysis Results"}}
{{else if dashboardUrl}}
{{> button url=dashboardUrl label="View Analysis Results"}}
{{/if}}
